  "description": "Programmatic PowerPoint slide sections for EVM reporting. Each IPptSlideSection adds a slide to a Syncfusion.Presentation IPresentation. Pairs with Cayaqui.MPS.ExcelExport and Cayaqui.MPS.ReportModels.",
